WEBVTT

00:00:27.482 --> 00:00:30.735
and the work trucks
filled with lumber and steel.

00:00:32.987 --> 00:00:35.114
Now picture the construction crew

00:00:36.699 --> 00:00:41.746
hard at work in their DayGlo vests
and hard hats,

00:00:42.789 --> 00:00:45.708
their tool belts
slung over dusty dungarees.

00:00:47.502 --> 00:00:52.006
Now picture that that crew is all women.

00:00:53.132 --> 00:00:56.302
(Applause)

00:00:56.385 --> 00:00:59.847
(Saw whirs)